{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30012_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3fc4182b6af0efee73fec2287564c9c4a4a41e76e40f6ebd4c8c638872ccc352",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa2525dc5ff7fc0a7ddf3a0d04a40ced96e44e010d74ebb63fdfa7f2225631d7",
      "text": "手工制作·心贴心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0125e754cbd475aae749fb8101e4edc64122984f470e02084d027394963b804c",
      "text": "负责解答观众来信的“毛茸茸登场！\n救援战队！”环节交到了もふもふえん三人手中。\n然而直央随着节目的推进，\n却开始为自己缺乏自信而苦恼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000021:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000021:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa2525dc5ff7fc0a7ddf3a0d04a40ced96e44e010d74ebb63fdfa7f2225631d7",
      "text": "手工制作·心贴心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb1f9118967e9c2625fc90db7332d16b90987ad56d639b460642f40682fcc65a",
      "text": "毛茸茸登场！救援战队！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb81823f677f6c679a596a893c4465893e521796e339792107383f30e427b86",
      "text": "各位小朋友，大家好！我们是もふもふえん。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c28e148e41fb70ec2f664b08ea32df522106bac0c53b45c0619c0eb567042777",
      "text": "今天，我们三个人也将继续为\n各位小朋友解答寄来的烦恼咨询！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb7673565eda31dfcd4fa8e3ab2e717436e7acc1870b92877c714ede32ea0d4d",
      "text": "第一封来信，是来自茂君的咨询。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf84d89b733b08f0e6d5156dc912d6f4fb7d0845596d2f63fb3f7bcbcb2595a",
      "text": "“我想在运动会的班级接力赛前跑得更快。\n请问我该怎么做才好呢？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a3045bc6b6f8695cde7d4ca26f72a0a0cae61eeef59b0b902fbf98f46f41360",
      "text": "花音也很不擅长赛跑呢～\n想要跑得快，真的很难对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1072726d51a911df35c873315b8f5393f80c88d43a6ed1669179dfe8ca398ecf",
      "text": "嘿嘿，既然是这种烦恼就包在本大爷身上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce3835e7113da25e112b6a912f39ba73c2d06155ab759c21bfe0d536c7ccfc23",
      "text": "我最喜欢运动身体了！就由志狼大人我，\n来帮他干脆利落地把烦恼彻底解决掉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39c9053c246b447f14a19b7996cdd0a0781eb54e7a883f1bb8819cb230d18ad9",
      "text": "……好，OK！\n辛苦各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2",
      "text": "辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d115ebb31e7b175f7851dcef0d63b5ab80b3a90f0099af62b86fd60b86c8232e",
      "text": "呼，真没想到居然跑了那么多趟。\n不过，能够顺利结束太好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20e43e9613a8c3cbafc83dad631a10316cb0b9a77dde12c4c85b48cffefea9a9",
      "text": "嘿嘿，本大爷玩得超开心！\n展现了好多帅气的英姿呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9840ce53c5f1e3c6740ac7d61d0484bf5c1e5b7bd3b1806794b37456a917f2f5",
      "text": "今天表现最亮眼的，绝对就是本大爷了吧！\n节目播出的时候，真是超级让人期待啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd901460e7f3395a1a80d5644f184de4a7a8be1226486ad8088fbe4d0493846f",
      "text": "哇……志狼君，还是这么精力充沛呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ab37e1f2ac8e488425143918f43b0d000da34d7675ab30aa69f6cab15dccec4",
      "text": "花音已经一步也动不了了啦～\n志狼君，背背花音嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_b:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f32950de1e33c7456fcfcf03db2a5b2168159a4afa5c6aaa7be0dafa96cf401",
      "text": "哼，真没出息！\n那种程度根本算不了什么好吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d635e743c7bd04c1197caf087d85280b219a13ba3d64a13f5f0ddee835ad1936",
      "text": "各位，拍摄辛苦了。\n我给大家买了饮料，请用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f93fb8e03d6571059d3d75cc5bba94090506166a51029edceed055a1c84c37a0",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f08b938ef20c639a327b2526e18b49b8a521315196aed5816e29489f3222df9",
      "text": "哇，是花音最喜欢的果汁♪\n那花音开动啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1ab2e429aaddfe314f0daeedc4866724c170b909f9f3faa96cbc0554776264d",
      "text": "稍微休息一下再回事务所吧。\n今天做了那么多运动，应该都累坏了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d1df5bf5211a33205473d6aa0730a559acf20451d9fe056149f59340b491a59",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那种程度对本大爷来说根本不在话下！\n不过嘛，果汁我还是不客气地收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdecb77aaf2f3a91cdd21d1d01337def758fa8302d3e47fd678cbed8a20965a9",
      "text": "嗯，当然可以。\n今天志狼君也大显身手了，别客气请尽情享用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d5bc525dea5e0f7722d13f06a065e170053a3d81c04cf7fb35f0b429fa5b648",
      "text": "而且，花音君和直央君也是……\n多亏了大家的努力，节目的反响非常好哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:255cc204d994bd5bc6192332b2040d3c01e21fc0451d33e2097455161b233b03",
      "text": "虽然是期间限定，但能在教育节目中拥有专属板块\n可是难得的机遇。接下来也要继续加油哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d08842cf75fe51f1851e9897a23e2d577e131a86e81a8dc0f025da72ce5d8b40",
      "text": "嗯！花音会拼命努力的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f48a8074d10da17a5f077cf9177a34f834e579b2191376803eec52e0799c4864",
      "text": "哦！……话说，直央你不加油的吗？\n从刚才开始就一句话都不说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:387140ec7fda0a16bbca05f3b2366f4d116ec3acc13cc00d5c9a15d5720293c3",
      "text": "……哎？啊，不是啦！\n当然，我也会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:729cb1065f5944dfee5271bb21a1d7bd21fcfdd0368a5984ff7cdb03ea15cac6",
      "text": "另一天的录制中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:263c5d166f7b29e207e58a3301a10b1021422b44ec04a83fb835315815bda4d8",
      "text": "今天我们大家，一起来到了兔子公园哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8d44e6185a925f21019825d06f4deb4033a73dc248e7c18f81a6e05e8ec9c6",
      "text": "快看！有小兔子的游乐设施哦！\n超级可爱的对吧～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50dc8f829cfd364764e73b97f436df0187871e9946d3455b75bc6e49c3aef594",
      "text": "今天，由我们もふもふえん来解答\n裕香小朋友寄来的来信！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d87b00b28342a416dfad95fb5b48ad6cc00ea2c2d6608f21c7be48843164fe33",
      "text": "来信是说，想让我们调查一下为什么这个公园里的\n游乐设施全都是小兔子的形状对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9f999f31622bd5174101207286770047447753c6a4bc49b2891b580857c5b0d",
      "text": "所以，我们请来了管理人员叔叔！\n我说叔叔，为什么全都是小兔子的形状啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b622b1ee81bed32e733c9c64011d297a3fac4f02946c4be6c13c8b791eab1e6e",
      "text": "唔——让我想想。\n其实叔叔也不是特别清楚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c80b109a428548a7994a1b867039b6741e57ae72142416e94783d824864d815",
      "text": "大概是因为建造公园的人，\n很喜欢小兔子吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3899bd9d20d17bb2b6e655a6cf34cc70301fe1cf69ae34f28ec405eb5169b1f1",
      "text": "哇！和花音一样呢！\n小兔子超级可爱的嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18a15491bd1e42ec2eb348c819cce5dc878b651fb6e0c3a3721871dd7ba6d21a",
      "text": "既然要建，建更帅气的\n动物明明更好嘛！比如大灰狼之类的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:442c3405be79e2ae993c8aa92544768591d85fffbecf9fe6093b28664c7852b1",
      "text": "啊哈哈，那样感觉也很有趣呢。\n不过可能有些小朋友会被吓到就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_d:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1031332cc7d089fc98b281928fac92a0160dfaf6d9cab880d5b580f7f2c3416b",
      "text": "叔叔，谢谢您告诉我们！\n裕香小朋友，也谢谢你的来信！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:729cb1065f5944dfee5271bb21a1d7bd21fcfdd0368a5984ff7cdb03ea15cac6",
      "text": "另一天的录制中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7bdc40cb154987cc558b317ceb10a287825337059789641354f34a98b4ee239",
      "text": "哟！今天为了回答“最喜欢将棋、\n想要变强”的这封来信……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2b17ff9a545758b482fcf16df929b4415abad58aaa44fde4fb2c9db31ba52df",
      "text": "我们来到了这家将棋俱乐部的教室！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93fd3a80c526e3658d68894aa01b457c6e6739335c9cee6fdca04ed37692d8a3",
      "text": "今天是直央君大展身手的日子呢～\n直央君下将棋超级厉害的哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60dae54b9a7601c5429e4bed4f2f17c92caeec31593068e65c933adeea058127",
      "text": "他从以前开始就经常下棋嘛～\n所以，到底要怎么做才能变得像直央那么强啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:169ba90361983363af752dd8ac1b53e7a42cdd6e41c7bea01f23c49c7eed15f6",
      "text": "没、没有啦，我也没有厉害到那种程度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1606f47f2e89743b1b28cc43dbf5c91775c6ef071be34e05e03002034cfbe34",
      "text": "我平时总是看棋谱……那个，就是通过观摩厉害的人的\n对局记录来进行学习……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5255b395ea9de160bed1fad3cfd3b96de244185c1fe5c396aa5010bcc2c55fa",
      "text": "还有就是模仿书本上的着法，\n一点一点地练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e061682c2c4643c32d25b444ce692180288b6b91ced40c43a606ed8898de0b32",
      "text": "呐呐，直央君！\n花音想看直央君下将棋的样子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d2d258df4208bb9f9a2ae698cf5f03cdebc0886ba039dd8f37bf6a7c43b70b1",
      "text": "说的也是，机会难得，直接边下一边\n教他不就好了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:006aee7d5f829164cac9a3b494626070c640f5a5dee6f5f78749c929be2c0d54",
      "text": "我、我也没有自信到能教别人的程度啦……\n不过难得有这个机会。那就只下一局哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed",
      "text": "拍摄结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49febddb80777eafa798bfb98a37accab8f7b2ac0f39397649b48bce61be154f",
      "text": "（今天的拍摄也非常顺利呢。\n……咦？在那边的是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7942f201fe3413dbf3ad5b95305ea79cb4159aa10e339130573b407325e8bb73",
      "text": "直央君，怎么了吗？志狼君和\n花音君好像都已经回去了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a76082798d9e9c9adeadb49c9c3d371e36fd432773a6b7c9281a578621b0d2d4",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n那个，我只是在想一些事情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3c3fcfc95dc01b7c1f39ca16c3d0794f3872725f337e3f3b12efe0b6d2998ec",
      "text": "确实，看起来表情稍微有些凝重呢。\n是录制遇到了什么问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f0f51b7974746596a236e4502ead5ae0a3f918e4f041abed9ccc43cb7beca70",
      "text": "没有，节目本身没有任何问题。\n只是……关于我自己的事，稍微有点烦恼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d4d2f610012ed9e4acfcf571279e6f044ce687c9767224a389c84c9c5d102e6",
      "text": "我对自己完全没有自信。这样的我，\n真的能够成为谁的依靠吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cc15b3c91c6773aa457686c67d2923609ee68973d41b2a9b8d9660e2740416a",
      "text": "今天也是，虽然聊了好多关于将棋的事，\n但我一直在想……自己到底有没有好好给出回答呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e89692544d6882f5faea162e10a7742c3d2ca5a6a282a56b1f6dc8a1e29d1c81",
      "text": "没事的。我认为直央君是拥有\n能够帮助他人的力量的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:add643dd87a6a70f47b066da40fc6a8214f15351f772117a64604d8e3e045dce",
      "text": "之前在幼儿园的毕业典礼上，你不也成功逗笑了大家嘛，\n这次的节目也是一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffe10c46741f0b3420229020f02353acaea337e33a3844572ac3e178f01a7652",
      "text": "你为了能帮上大家的忙而认真付出的样子，\n我都看在眼里。所以请放宽心吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e4b9db1b03573147b4613ba41ddb249c17dad6abd2f7e93f804a874e4c5246b",
      "text": "是……这样吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69acfbff700e195800a2662c5b45e0462ccf73d11f9368a28f55e7c400fe4f9e",
      "text": "……不过，听你这么说我稍微放心了一点。\n非常感谢您，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000107:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000121:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d760bd062ae44d54a93d85742e9af0f4eeda4a909da11d5179d2b16a5b83d48",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ca9abf917ffb6663ec6c80e123842b9948ba0e10fca18078d9e741591cf06f5",
      "text": "之前不是有封邮件，说想试试黄瓜和蜂蜜一起吃\n会不会变成哈密瓜的味道嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41b042876e5808806d6d2a6201a297ddaa23b9f172767b20caf5cc881567165a",
      "text": "那次啊，花音虽然说根本不是哈密瓜的味道……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f321fea9f79ce08365b3f36264b30a8a7bc8064d767224e8f80640b72528d4c1",
      "text": "但那绝对就是哈密瓜的味道吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bb014255fd96723d9a2774b1ec3df8687971ca0178893b623f05b45a6022f47",
      "text": "我当时都惊呆了！\n明明超级好吃的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000131:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7b53e14eead1900751254aa1385876fea3537fdcc41d3287ae6e63d4b4c5dd5",
      "text": "制作人，你还知道其他这种搭配吗？\n就是把食物组合在一起的吃法！我想试试看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000133:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:164395641398cd64c525626dfbd2f9aa71ce9b36d840691e8023467ab6950923",
      "text": "布丁加酱油\n会变成海胆味哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000134:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76e24433860d58cf98af207257603d9ae0fc5bf512d98ce006b9bf49a3f9ccbf",
      "text": "话梅加牛奶\n会变成奶酪味哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000137:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47995d6c22ba2e47f83f3a06c122e4507f36c75e962be20786720fbd0e94d97f",
      "text": "哎……那真的假的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000139:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4d04c48aea34e78d2a652b3708ff9856c3748293c0e5e086ca586c58f75f779",
      "text": "感觉，听上去不太好吃的样子啊……\n不过既然好不容易告诉我了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_f:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:714e104fb7a96b8387927b97d11377561379a92da52fa33c810b4ee10ec02684",
      "text": "改天我们在事务所试一试吧！\n制作人你也得陪我一起吃啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a935f31fd3dc98105a89d09995486c4fda7fdaaecf443990c96b9cd1f2b5402f",
      "text": "（今天是为了下次录制开碰头会。\n这次节目收到的咨询是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdca24dbe03f99ea817957a8ecada7cb7d6efc7b8f642c786c37ead6b4f3c7f3",
      "text": "咦，下次是指名给我的来信吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66786bf51ca2e7dee06b650b8a31ebb65c3314fe2b79231a87fc9bd5b04c76c3",
      "text": "嘿，让我瞧瞧。“想改变自己\n爱哭又缺乏自信的性格”啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee3fe03b3cdf1bb5467fa9611981837679d0e270229e8b80ee0bc2cc1bd2946a",
      "text": "哇，好厉害啊直央君！\n被别人依靠着，好帅气♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a325e78e58a17432638c69ab6f9a61f7275592fa14f9e9a6755f1e1fca0383f",
      "text": "嗯、嗯。\n……但是，真的由我来解答没问题吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c165f2ded63cde3b3a581f573cec2beccac46ec6f17318dff0c4d75305bcaef",
      "text": "毕竟信里写着“希望能请教和大人混在一起、\n努力工作的直央君”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:403cad5c2c2b66382ed398b6cc729938afac970e96833d205497c0e73bba5e4e",
      "text": "对方平时一定也是以直央君为榜样，\n想要成为像你这样的人吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be460129c725f755eda6616fa58c54d577275b7121f619d6df04f72481086a36",
      "text": "（可、可是……连我自己都对自己毫无信心啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11f943ec707735a058f9d856f299009aecff1e3532c619cbd96406ecc9fd8fe4",
      "text": "（怎么办，好想说自己做不到……\n可是，如果我拒绝了的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed2e0e1930aa232ac7ad55bfae13075cb8ec8c23a034c444d0374eb4ff5e9e86",
      "text": "直央君，你打算怎么做？\n这封信，作为下次节目的主题可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cc76652faf7c44ca8b53d46326cce3208cf3504e705cbf5459caca29350402e",
      "text": "呃、那个……\n……我、我会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9abf44377a36f9fae5a2b49a43ab37a3422db5e8fe54d9c7a0fdbfc7560ab332",
      "text": "（唉……结果，还是硬着头皮答应下来了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3590ffe3ef47a98f111aee99dcd5ecbba7721a2bea233a5fd0e9694e232d05d",
      "text": "（每一次，都是这样。\n总是没法把自己的想法好好说出口）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84afa8f4b08514e91623c1bc2ff3372e6b77689f2102a2ac1ae205acfeb9b0ff",
      "text": "（这次的工作也是一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c764b55b8a456d2379e95e444eb31418a10e441ac6c6b002c7e48460decea0f1",
      "text": "（●●●●プロデューサー虽然说我做得很好，\n但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dadd941b21e4a256eb45f7d2483c91fcaf6081c3f451adf4cd0deb5e4005fca7",
      "text": "（我真的，有好好做好吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9880bd9dee73c09c8a08d858a95edbed08e49c5591f865ec9d719e58b9a7069",
      "text": "（赛跑的时候，也是多亏了志狼君\n总算撑过去了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:447493b062149cc8f4422898ec3072bf40011348be285a4cd1fb2ddcedd095fa",
      "text": "（在兔子公园那次，也是因为花音君说了很多话，\n现场才热闹起来的对吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5fcd0c75132cf95a571b9dcda1c478e8cd1d106e4d41136cbe6ac66617dc415",
      "text": "（相比之下我呢，在将棋那次也是\n紧张得没办法顺畅地表达……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2038f9481f15830ee6711e8c1bb8c4d36030c51cde686d772e9d1d871d2abd75",
      "text": "（……想改变爱哭的自己，吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e78065eca47b62a56e20bf0fad4226f28619087eb4ef9fe77d8f98c44eb3409",
      "text": "（我虽然很想回答他，其实做现在的自己就已经很好了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a2f5b5105e94c0dd4f4f6c04babe2cc3408a08dcb858000d3ca140d11970173",
      "text": "（可是，连我都在为自己缺乏自信而苦恼，\n根本没办法挺起胸膛这么说啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4f090702aca5cf4eab962229816659dd4b34ee4e80b292b9ce16cf280ad8ba7",
      "text": "……找大家商量一下，应该可以吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000171:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69baa00b365241d19d2f2948b1f8335b8957da94ca0494715823bca41145e51c",
      "text": "突然打扰非常抱歉。\n请问现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000173:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c8ab65d5bf59e73715eb445fdbfc0d1c4c92ce08eaee4d0df08cfe69e65ce88",
      "text": "发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000173:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12dd40629e8542209b43074cbaaee8aaffe29db9c78b22b2871b040a59ccd479",
      "text": "嗯，方便的哦。\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01b3532573f1401a6a2f38404f372f51d5d8993e151bf8a3c3959a2462d3d199",
      "text": "直央君，怎么啦？\n是很重要的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a2972932189f8b8084a5c17002d86eb283226a971688b21b5e4fe0c3dc30d6",
      "text": "有件事，想找大家\n商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90a62bc113d62fbf678b464d4e57a086ef0b5704e1877de73276253e3d5bb37",
      "text": "什么事啊？\n你想商量的事情",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000182:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c4363ce467f6a2d2030f6b9aa02234bc219a80f3a36d09bfe9100bba8da97b4",
      "text": "在LINK上不太容易说清楚，\n所以，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000184:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b59e7edc820cbfd868eba33c24f89c3a6912c2c6e5e69053cf855b52541de47d",
      "text": "明天，大家可以在事务所\n当面聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000186:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000186:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d53ba4e1e42ffd949dc7b50519ded971dd6f0cfefc0511d1f6faf8cc75fbb632",
      "text": "明白了！那么明天，\n我们抽时间聚一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000189:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d960f761ac63bfcf1e527d4426cbbfa8a06705b1ea100c0565dcde9d7e5e749",
      "text": "好！\n花音也有空哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000191:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4639c9f9eceab42f6016f27490ce5aa8395590522ab731bba8569f8662cf604",
      "text": "真是拿你没办法啊！\n那本大爷就稍微抽点时间\n陪你一下吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000193:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95d9269dc441f9f57f8d1daff24fa4c7359046c6ef6063b5021e469bf751d5f8",
      "text": "谢谢大家。\n制作人，\n明天也拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5199287a15bc54e1fb808671827bd3b2561b825bec0d41a591daa9b1526dd88",
      "text": "……我是这么想的。所以，\n由这样的我来回答那封咨询的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6d783780b14cd81598df7372d923af1da44c58ff16cf4d8866e5075b694bb56",
      "text": "我说啊，直央确实是个胆小鬼没错，\n但这有什么不好的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f22ae5d55a510f57d21d03d043941085cf771fd4f5e1be8c4d98bcc5ae412a2",
      "text": "是这样哦。而且直央君身上，\n不是有很多非常棒的闪光点吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:782c9b6a39e5e81e3dc28e9cdfae23be63fb6719b624e66ed53afe81cf9198c8",
      "text": "平时总是那么认真，对待工作全力以赴……\n前阵子将棋的咨询也是一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bb17f70a6f420cbaabbd484b3dcfa3b06dcf85b481f8aae2adc1eabac5177ca",
      "text": "你特意来向我征求意见，\n问“我可以自己准备棋谱吗”，对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a510206cd465bae30da03a648addcffc6da1c99180f457aa4651848bb31ef0d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……\n还有，志狼君也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f90f7f0dc21fe842f50d8f535e57d797aacc8f9c90e2a930f8ec9eab6361d8b",
      "text": "花音也觉得哦，直央君虽然有点胆小，\n但花音最喜欢温柔的直央君了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d1f20405345c83d9e6334f1df88883ee9b4177a5c7d1274bfafeacfcd29c56b",
      "text": "对花音的玩偶也很温柔……\n所以花音觉得，完全不用那么在意啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2b74d123db205a7932bcbae64e06d8577f25c8ae4f42ea0df80dc93551877f2",
      "text": "（……原来是这样。\n虽然之前，我一直对自己毫无信心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65ba2add66b9acd1e67ff88b311581c8961e68f674c046fa1b12f77378129b83",
      "text": "（但只要尽自己所能去努力，\n就一定会有人好好看在眼里的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c69090821a76833cea75f9c276ca662b729b7698beb1dd91169296882c2a9676",
      "text": "（好……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:289ad94be62aea93472f30495df5701e062bf87f8c80e6e3a428379bdda23c91",
      "text": "谢谢大家。\n托大家的福，我终于知道该怎么做了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce0441934ff6d3119e5389148d8a6b23537bfefbd8cf3bef248a62bd172ba383",
      "text": "我……想试着回答那个孩子的烦恼。现在的话，\n我觉得自己能够用自己的语言传达给他了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e30c75e46b95524875e4b74bef09c912d8efa83b5ef6ab186ee36afbc8710510",
      "text": "嗯！请加油哦，直央君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000091:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d7bc51a82d4d2a5466db70d62d504445442966aa428fa1b72ca14cd36343da1",
      "text": "节目收录当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad942855d6f00bfa6fb4e5bf2b99c215ac3df6e35eefa37a40f34ff9f6df7bdb",
      "text": "那么，我来读信了。今天这封来信，\n来自正为自己缺乏自信而苦恼的大翔小朋友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c1cfc564c57e61eb8341466c41dd2a638645114bcc236ebbba85e6236602872",
      "text": "“我是个爱哭鬼，对自己没有信心。\n但是，我很想改变这样的自己”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d44e6a1f444561c8ad4d4509772bda6df61e0f58cedf3da8516d3d94fc32a610",
      "text": "“希望能请教和大人混在一起、努力工作的\n直央君，有没有什么好办法呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:410e7843eb00885e8dad7e8d4b367a16fb8198774e3ff2f6bfc9918c77c63ae1",
      "text": "……嗯。那个，虽然我自己\n也并不是特别有自信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9cec5eec1fea6c7efba40ec8f43f57f3853712f458d100d74dc813a5152690",
      "text": "但是，只要按照自己的步调去努力，\n就一定会有人认可你的付出的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_j:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae9431e225888dd99cc1682f1d07cd533df2c95b0a6453e7402974e7aeb8c970",
      "text": "所以，试着接纳这样的自己，\n学着与自己好好相处……我是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7f4fd76a9cfc32cec224d104e6d8e45ec5505f3a725fcbf46082946ca40397",
      "text": "嗯！花音也觉得是这样哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb609e56c936e7ae1585e9da11114ff0dab7346e276822ca26dc1fe73a62a561",
      "text": "直央君真的超级努力的嘛！\n花音好崇拜你哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79457f9a27dec4598cb281c9d208bf0b39774e3aadec5037e5a1e13985ad702f",
      "text": "嘛，确实如此。所以大翔只要把力所能及的事\n一股脑全做个遍不就好了嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32ee8efb26439743c3e544d04c002b80720b8429d1861d8616fad40e93186667",
      "text": "嗯！而且志狼君也是，虽然有点粗鲁，\n但也是个努力家，其实很不错的哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a59dfc94caec24172a365f9ad9cb76d04e924a9498a8baa0adb64f1b130440c9",
      "text": "花音你虽然是个小不点，\n但多亏了你才能衬托出本大爷的亮眼啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:025352641698637e4b62d2879379065a1f243bf78128fc69969a5f9cfe96f016",
      "text": "啊哈哈。……那个，虽然我们大家也有各自擅长的事、\n不擅长的事，各种各样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c63b18539e778bfed0a0dcfc7123465f4c694f62055534b3bd727b6480e4bf68",
      "text": "但肯定每个人都有自己的优点哦。\n所以，不用勉强自己非要把爱哭的性格改掉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f97582a836c84492be754fdcd3e7cd8084a623835ad36d6d9a11e05d691191fb",
      "text": "一边好好接纳自己，一边向大家展现出自己拼命努力的\n一面，我觉得这样就很棒了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:813f90f45ea301b9e297512f6f2420f9f4125ed81c560a170fcf4404c0793c6f",
      "text": "没毛病。只要不轻言放弃，\n绝对会有人注视着大翔的付出的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:593e8b73cc868f86657434737407935fc4b1d6b9099be4425bf716d2194a5897",
      "text": "要加油哦，大翔君！\n花音会大力为你加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41701bf2365f1f36c8e3ca8777f12a39460fd701b7414b50485b6e3aeb3bc18a",
      "text": "嗯，我也会为你加油的。\n虽然不知道刚才的回答能不能帮上你的忙……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_k:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b5101410c9563f1ad0867f1dbd1555826531140a39de77d71714b441c1afdfa",
      "text": "我也会继续加油的，所以我们一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
